WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.050
One Mighty Morphin' Power Rangers wrist watch
communicator toy was placed into the Clockworks

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.040
on the setting "Very fine."

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.360
The output produced was: The same wrist-comm.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:15.000
Upon putting it on to test communications
functions, the D-class disappeared in a beam

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.400
of orange light that shot off towards the
western United States.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.730
Satellite tracked it for 27 minutes until
it reached the Brandeis-Bardin Campus at the

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:28.840
American Jewish University in Simi Valley,
California, where the D-class rematerialized

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.119
and impacted the roof.

00:00:31.119 --> 00:00:32.230
D-class terminated.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:36.610
Professor Wren was baffled by this until he
looked at satellite photos of the place the

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:38.040
D-Class wound up.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:43.180
That building was apparently used as the Command
Center in the original Power Rangers.

